A R 0~
cerrmullossa slithering~
Cerrmullossa the Slithering~
A trail of waste ends here at Cerrmullossa the Slithering.
~
   It's form is that of a giant slug, oozing every nasty fluid of your
nightmares.  Cerrmullossa stands, if you can call it that, five feet tall, and
still has about seven feet of length on the ground.  It's entire mass seems to
be made of some mix of blood, puss, pond slime and other unmentionable fluids.
It's two tentacles drop with a murky yellow fluid and small geysers of blood
erupt from the upright portion of this being.  Maggots dot her outer surface
and several things move just below the surface, which seemingly cause
Cerrmullosa moderate pain!  The trail this wide behemoth leaves on the ground
is black and crimson and just plain fiendish.    
~
